[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0263","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0263.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4379","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 堆溢出漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 及 RealPlayer SP 等多款播放器在解析 SIPR 文件格式时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过诱导用户打开精心构造的恶意 SIPR 文件，触发堆缓冲区溢出，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 11.0-11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0-1.1.4、RealPlayer Enterprise 2.1.2、Mac RealPlayer 11.0-11.1、Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744 及可能的 HelixPlayer 1.0.6 等版本，CVSS 评分 9.3（严重），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度中等、无需身份认证，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性完全丧失。RealNetworks 已在 12.0.1.609 版本中修复此漏洞，用户应升级至最新版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4379"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:40Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本（可从 RealNetworks 官网下载最新版本）。若无法立即升级，建议卸载 RealPlayer 或禁用浏览器中的 RealPlayer 插件/ActiveX 控件，并配置防火墙阻止 RealPlayer 网络访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0981.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4379.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4379","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4379.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4379.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-8267-gm3r-x6g6/GHSA-8267-gm3r-x6g6.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_CESA-2010_0981_HelixPlayer-uninstall_centos4_i386.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/centos_RHSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x46000/45421/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_114300_114400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2f704f11-9d50-431d-8bed-48812b5301e0.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0263.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0262","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0262.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4378","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer RV20 解析堆内存破坏代码执行与拒绝服务漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 的 drv2.dll（RV20 解压缩模块）中存在堆内存破坏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的 RV20 视频流，其中包含精心构造的未指定长度字段值，触发堆内存损坏，导致拒绝服务或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.5、RealPlayer Enterprise 2.1.2 和 2.1.3、Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744 以及 HelixPlayer 1.0.6 等版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。用户需升级至 RealPlayer 12.0.1.609 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4378"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:40Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本。RealNetworks 已于 2010 年 12 月发布安全更新修复此漏洞。由于 RealPlayer 已停止维护，建议彻底卸载 RealPlayer 并改用 VLC 等替代播放器，同时在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer 相关 ActiveX 插件和 NPAPI 插件以防止远程利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0981.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-274","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4378.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4378","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4378.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4378.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-823r-m433-5jp9/GHSA-823r-m433-5jp9.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_CESA-2010_0981_HelixPlayer-uninstall_centos4_i386.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/centos_RHSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_114300_114400.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/redhat-RHSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f2ed4fdb-c37b-4cf8-91a8-3b165ffeffe2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0262.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0261","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0261.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4377","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 堆 corrupt 代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 的 Cook 音频编解码器存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。当解析 Real Audio 文件中 cook 音频编解码器信息时，未对 subbands 字段数量进行正确边界检查，攻击者可构造包含大量 subbands 的恶意 Real Audio 文件，诱使用户打开后触发堆缓冲区溢出，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.5、Mac RealPlayer 11.0 至 12.0.0.1444 及 Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744 版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。用户需升级至 RealPlayer 12.0.1.609 及以上版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4377"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:40Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本（Windows/Mac/Linux 统一版本号）。若无法立即升级，可卸载 RealPlayer 并改用其他播放器，或在防火墙层面禁止 RealPlayer 访问网络以防止恶意 Real Audio 文件触发漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-272","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4377.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4377","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4377.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4377.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-272c-7cjj-8qc6/GHSA-272c-7cjj-8qc6.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2a7b0077-bc22-4b87-a8db-93551cefcdf6.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realplayer_12_0_1_609.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-4377.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0261.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0260","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0260.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4376","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer RTSP GIF解析堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 在处理 RTSP 流中的 GIF87a 文件时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于程序未正确验证 GIF 文件 Screen Descriptor 头部的 Screen Width 字段大小，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含特制大宽度值的 GIF87a 图像的 RTSP 流触发堆缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.1、Mac RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1 及 Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744 版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。用户需升级至 RealPlayer 12.0.1.609 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4376"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:40Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本。Windows 用户可通过 RealPlayer 内置更新功能检查并安装更新，或从 real.com 下载最新版本。Linux 用户应升级至 11.0.2.1744 以上版本。如无法升级，可在防火墙或代理层面阻止对不可信 RTSP 流媒体的访问，并禁用浏览器中 RealPlayer 对 RTSP 协议的处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/45411","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-271","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4376.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4376","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4376.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4376.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-5p9m-hxc7-hpwp/GHSA-5p9m-hxc7-hpwp.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_02_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_114300_114400.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realplayer_12_0_1_609.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--316155d0-c35b-4b49-9190-f6f64c44b51e.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x46000/45411/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0260.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0259","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0259.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4375","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 多速率音频处理堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 11.0至11.1版本（含Windows、Mac及Linux平台）以及HelixPlayer 1.0.6等多款媒体播放软件的多速率音频处理模块存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意多速率数据的音频流文件，诱使用户在受影响播放器中打开该文件，触发堆缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞CVSS评分9.3，危害等级严重，无需身份认证即可远程利用，但需要用户交互（打开恶意文件）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4375"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:40Z","remediation":"将 RealPlayer 升级至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本（RealNetworks 于 2010 年 12 月发布的安全更新）。Linux 用户应升级至 11.0.2.1744 以上版本。对于 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 4 上的 HelixPlayer，执行 `rpm -e HelixPlayer` 卸载该软件包（RHSA-2010:0981）。临时缓解措施：不要打开或播放来自不可信来源的媒体文件/流，并在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer 相关插件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0981.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-266","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4375.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4375","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4375.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4375.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-v5c6-8332-w725/GHSA-v5c6-8332-w725.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_CESA-2010_0981_HelixPlayer-uninstall_centos4_i386.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/centos_RHSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--88d477d9-f296-4c19-914b-fb73aa4642e5.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/redhat-RHSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-4375.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0259.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0195","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0195.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2999","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer AAC MLLT Atom 解析整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 11.0至11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0至1.0.1、Mac RealPlayer 11.0至11.1及Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744版本中的AAC文件解析组件存在整数溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过构造恶意的MLLT atom（多位置定位表）的AAC音频文件，诱导用户使用RealPlayer打开，触发堆内存破坏，成功利用可实现远程代码执行或导致拒绝服务。该漏洞CVSS评分9.3，危害等级严重，无需身份认证即可利用，但需要用户交互。建议用户升级至RealPlayer 12.0.1.609及以上版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2999"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:56Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本。RealPlayer 已于 2012 年停止维护，建议彻底卸载 RealPlayer 并改用 VLC、MPC-HC 等仍在维护的媒体播放器。如因业务必须使用，在无法升级的情况下，不要在浏览器中安装 RealPlayer 浏览器插件，不要打开来源不明的 AAC 音频文件，并在网络边界和主机防火墙中阻止 RealPlayer 对外部服务器的主动连接请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-273","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2999.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2999","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-2999.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-2999.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-m282-r3hp-qhhf/GHSA-m282-r3hp-qhhf.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_03_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_114100_114200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3735caf0-dd8b-48a6-82d5-5ea27f0e872c.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x46000/45409/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-2999.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0195.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0193","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0193.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2997","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer SMIL文件格式StreamTitle释放后重用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 及 HelixPlayer 在处理 SMIL 文件格式时存在释放后重用漏洞。当解析 ICY SHOUTcast 流中特制的 StreamTitle 标签时，程序错误地访问已释放的内存，导致堆内存破坏。远程攻击者可构造恶意媒体流诱导用户播放，成功利用可实现任意代码执行或导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.0.1、Mac RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1、Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744 及 HelixPlayer 1.0.6 等版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2997"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:56Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本。Linux 平台 HelixPlayer 用户请安装 Red Hat 安全公告 RHSA-2010:0981 提供的更新包。如无法升级，建议在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer 插件，并避免打开来自不可信来源的 SMIL/ICY 流媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0981.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-270","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2997.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2997","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-2997.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-2997.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-4mw4-jp5f-4h89/GHSA-4mw4-jp5f-4h89.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_CESA-2010_0981_HelixPlayer-uninstall_centos4_i386.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/centos_RHSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_114100_114200.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/oraclelinux_ELSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--68b84231-ac3f-4fed-88fc-2643270b4423.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0193.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0184","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0184.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-2579","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer cook编解码器内存访问漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 的 Cook 音频编解码器在初始化时未正确设置声道数（number of channels），导致未初始化的内存访问漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制的媒体文件触发该漏洞，造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 11.0~11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0~1.1.4、RealPlayer Enterprise 2.1.2、Mac RealPlayer 11.0~11.1 及 Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744 等多个版本，攻击无需身份认证，利用复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-2579"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:21:01Z","remediation":"升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Cook 编解码器未初始化通道数导致的内存访问漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer 浏览器插件（NPAPI/ActiveX），并避免打开来源不明的媒体文件（.rm/.ra/.ram），以降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2010/2xxx/CVE-2010-2579.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-2579","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-2579.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/74