lPlayer 11.0.2.1744等多个版本。CVSS评分为10.0，攻击复杂度低且无需身份认证即可触发，危害等级严重。RealNetworks后续发布了安全更新修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2010-0121"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:31Z","remediation":"升级到 RealPlayer 12.0.1.609 或更高版本以修复 Cook codec 初始化缺陷。如无法立即升级，可禁用 RealPlayer 的 Cook 编解码器模块或在网络层面阻断来自不可信来源的媒体文件传输作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2010/0xxx/CVE-2010-0121.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-0121","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2010-0121.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-0121.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-xcff-45fg-j54m/GHSA-xcff-45fg-j54m.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_114100_114200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2fe22c50-ff72-4b9f-a323-cf1ebc834a8b.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2d886415eb211c94f75c60061c511bd893bafd48/2010/CVE-2010-0121.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2010/POC-AVE-2010-0120.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0120.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0255","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0255.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4009","title":"Apple QuickTime 整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime 7.6.9 之前版本在处理特制影片文件时存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-189）。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送恶意构造的影片文件，当用户使用 QuickTime 打开该文件时，触发整数溢出导致内存破坏，进而实现任意代码执行或造成应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响所有 QuickTime 7.6.9 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。攻击无需身份认证，仅需用户交互（打开恶意文件）即可触发。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4009"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-09T20:00:17Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:23:58Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple QuickTime 升级至 7.6.9 或更高版本，该版本修复了处理畸形 movie 文件时的整数溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在浏览器中禁用 QuickTime 插件，并避免打开来源不明的 .mov/.avi/.mp4 等媒体文件。对于 Windows 系统，还可通过组策略限制 QuickTime 对用户目录的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Dec/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2011/Mar/msg00006.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4447","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4581","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024830","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16218","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4009.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4009","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4009.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-36cj-p9c3-wm2q/GHSA-36cj-p9c3-wm2q.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4009.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/